<li class="gallerybox" style="width: 215px;" id="mwLQ"><div class="thumb" style="width: 210px; height: 210px;" id="mwLg"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwLw"><a href="https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bestand:Vincent_van_Gogh_-_Watermolen_in_Gennep.jpg" class="mw-file-description" title="De molen, door Vincent van Gogh (werk F125)" id="mwMA"><img resource="https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bestand:Vincent_van_Gogh_-_Watermolen_in_Gennep.jpg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/Vincent_van_Gogh_-_Watermolen_in_Gennep.jpg/250px-Vincent_van_Gogh_-_Watermolen_in_Gennep.jpg?utm_source=nl.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/Vincent_van_Gogh_-_Watermolen_in_Gennep.jpg/500px-Vincent_van_Gogh_-_Watermolen_in_Gennep.jpg?utm_source=nl.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="De molen, door Vincent van Gogh (werk F125)" data-file-width="2750" data-file-height="1576" data-file-type="bitmap" height="103" width="180" class="mw-file-element" id="mwMQ"/></a></span></div><div class="gallerytext" id="mwMg">De molen, door Vincent van Gogh (werk F125)</div></li>
